{"4115490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DiART Paintball", "steam_appid": 4115490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DiART Paintball delivers a fast-paced, fun, <i>arcade-style paintball</i> experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And while we embrace the excitement of an arcade shooter, our goal is to keep the action grounded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullets are physically simulated, leaning and crouching matters, and audio is key. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We aim to stand apart by balancing player and projectile speeds to reduce “campy” playstyles — yet careless rushing across the field will still lead to defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115490/extras/9541281a26e6af19ea13ae5d9495a6b9.poster.avif?t=1787075457\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115490/extras/9541281a26e6af19ea13ae5d9495a6b9.webm?t=1787075457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115490/extras/9541281a26e6af19ea13ae5d9495a6b9.mp4?t=1787075457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to Expect?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’re including a tutorial and 7 unique maps designed to test your skills in FFA and TDM modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play against bots or try our multiplayer mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matches support up to 10 players (5v5) in team modes and 8 players in FFA.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>A Singleplayer mode with progression and unlockable rewards is  in development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115490/extras/86b14ea63fcb7670e0f0824bfd3690fc.poster.avif?t=1787075457\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115490/extras/86b14ea63fcb7670e0f0824bfd3690fc.webm?t=1787075457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115490/extras/86b14ea63fcb7670e0f0824bfd3690fc.mp4?t=1787075457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Future:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There will never be pay-to-win mechanics in our game. <br>Our immediate focus is content, balance, and core gameplay quality.<br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115490/extras/140daca134b7e17e50dee804882bab18.poster.avif?t=1787075457\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115490/extras/140daca134b7e17e50dee804882bab18.webm?t=1787075457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115490/extras/140daca134b7e17e50dee804882bab18.mp4?t=1787075457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Dream Project</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creating this game has been a lifelong dream for us. <br>We can’t wait to see you on the field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115490/extras/fbe13796623fb8e4c3148dfa79630989.poster.avif?t=1787075457\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115490/extras/fbe13796623fb8e4c3148dfa79630989.webm?t=1787075457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115490/extras/fbe13796623fb8e4c3148dfa79630989.mp4?t=1787075457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DiART Paintball delivers a fast-paced, fun, <i>arcade-style paintball</i> experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And while we embrace the excitement of an arcade shooter, our goal is to keep the action grounded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullets are physically simulated, leaning and crouching matters, and audio is key. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We aim to stand apart by balancing player and projectile speeds to reduce “campy” playstyles — yet careless rushing across the field will still lead to defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115490/extras/9541281a26e6af19ea13ae5d9495a6b9.poster.avif?t=1787075457\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115490/extras/9541281a26e6af19ea13ae5d9495a6b9.webm?t=1787075457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115490/extras/9541281a26e6af19ea13ae5d9495a6b9.mp4?t=1787075457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to Expect?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’re including a tutorial and 7 unique maps designed to test your skills in FFA and TDM modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play against bots or try our multiplayer mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matches support up to 10 players (5v5) in team modes and 8 players in FFA.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>A Singleplayer mode with progression and unlockable rewards is  in development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115490/extras/86b14ea63fcb7670e0f0824bfd3690fc.poster.avif?t=1787075457\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115490/extras/86b14ea63fcb7670e0f0824bfd3690fc.webm?t=1787075457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115490/extras/86b14ea63fcb7670e0f0824bfd3690fc.mp4?t=1787075457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Future:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There will never be pay-to-win mechanics in our game. <br>Our immediate focus is content, balance, and core gameplay quality.<br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115490/extras/140daca134b7e17e50dee804882bab18.poster.avif?t=1787075457\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115490/extras/140daca134b7e17e50dee804882bab18.webm?t=1787075457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115490/extras/140daca134b7e17e50dee804882bab18.mp4?t=1787075457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Dream Project</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creating this game has been a lifelong dream for us. <br>We can’t wait to see you on the field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.ste